    "narrative": "The Austin Waves head into today\u2019s slate with a potent core, anchored by **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (71.52) and **Gunnar Henderson** (70.59), who represent our strongest offensive plays. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a favorable park factor and a solid matchup against Bassitt, maintaining high efficiency despite a slight platoon dip. **Gunnar Henderson** remains a must-start; while the dynamic platoon split against Corbin slightly tempers his raw projection, his position in the two-hole and the park-adjusted boost keep him comfortably in the elite tier. **Sam Antonacci** (67.67) is the surprise standout of the day, capitalizing on a high-upside matchup against Woods Richardson. His leadoff status coupled with elite SP skill adjustments makes him an excellent target for volume in the Roto standings.\n\nThe decision to bench **Miguel Vargas** (60.61) was the most difficult call of the morning. While he eclipsed the 60-point threshold, he ultimately fell short of the ceiling offered by **Coby Mayo** (65.57) and **Josh Jung** (61.01). **Coby Mayo** earns the nod over **Miguel Vargas** primarily due to his massive park adjustment and platoon advantage against Corbin, which significantly elevates his run production potential. **Josh Jung** secures his spot through a favorable SP matchup against Arrighetti, providing a reliable floor that narrowly edges out the bench alternatives.\n\nRegarding roster management, we continue to navigate the absence of **Luis Robert Jr.** and **Kyle Tucker**, leaving significant gaps in our speed and power output. We are monitoring the status of **Jackson Merrill**, **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jorge Polanco**, **Drake Baldwin**, **Josh Lowe**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Miguel Andujar**, **Nolan Schanuel**, **Brayan Rocchio**, and **Liam Hicks** to ensure our game caps are managed effectively. **Dominic Smith** (39.83) remains below our floor threshold for starts today, primarily due to an unfavorable platoon matchup against Tolle, and will be held on the bench to preserve our limited remaining appearances.",
